  "job_B9.2.6_20251003_115001": {
    "chunk_text": "a hie hie \u00fea On \u00fe\u00e6re tide Metellus se consul for on Belearis \u00fe\u00e6t land, & oferwan \u00fea wicingas \u00fee on \u00fe\u00e6t land \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DC wintrum & XXVII, Fauius se consul gemette \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s DC wintra & XXXV, \u00fea \u00fea Scipia Nasica & Lucius Se ilca Geoweor\u00f0a w\u00e6s Mecipsuses m\u00e6g, Nume\u00f0ia cyninges. & he hiene on his geogo\u00f0e underfeng, & hiene fedan het, & tyhtan mid his twam sunum. & \u00fea se cyning gefor, he bebead his tw\u00e6m sunum \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6s rices \u00feriddan d\u00e6l Geoweor\u00fean Ac si\u00fe\u00fean se \u00feridda d\u00e6l on his gewealde w\u00e6s, he beswac begen \u00fea suna: o\u00feerne he ofslog, & he si\u00fe\u00fean gesohte Romane him to fri\u00fee. & hie sendon Calfurnan \u00feone consul mid him mid firde. Ac Geoweor\u00f0a geceapade mid his feo \u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6m consule \u00fe\u00e6t he \u00fe\u00e6s gewinnes lytel \u00feurhteah. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Geoweor\u00fea com to Rome, & diegellice geceapade to \u00fe\u00e6m senatum, to anum & to \u00dea he hiene hamweard of \u00fe\u00e6re byrig wende, \u00fea t\u00e6lde he Romane, & hie swi\u00fee bismrade mid his \u00de\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare Romane sendon Anilius Mostumius \u00feone consul mid LX M angean Heora gemeting w\u00e6s \u00e6t Colima \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, & \u00fe\u00e6r w\u00e6ron Romane oferwunnen. & si\u00fe\u00fean lytle hwile hie genamon fri\u00fe him betweonum,",
